# Rebox.ng — Master Product Roadmap

Consolidated project status, completed work, remaining development, dependencies, and launch milestones.

Rebox is intended to become more than a conventional electronics marketplace. The vision is to build a device-intelligence and trust platform combined with a marketplace for verified devices.

The core differentiator is the technology behind each device: identifying it, matching its exact model and variant, gathering technical and verification evidence, assessing condition and trust, estimating value, and using that information to help buyers and sellers transact with greater confidence.

The guiding principle is “Every Device Has a Story.”

This roadmap combines the project work and source-file inventory already established. It is not yet a verified line-by-line audit of the uploaded ZIP, so features whose runtime behavior has not been demonstrated are marked accordingly.

## 1. The destination: what Rebox must become

[ITSALES NZ – Business Laptops, Monitors, Servers & IT Equipment](https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/25TmkE-n9f9PomjyYnZ_8imA1vBZW6PB7qwNfuPgR_gH-xE_WzOHoqSE8aA3oftVb7ynbSzyofYgiKGSJy23jrpVRFJZ0Yfo-ugqiz5QKHCI-Agzn4gQJZo2-tN1Uwv-bWZY2SESmx6PGp6tHUX23TQK9hNNcnyuL8kRwOxo6PM?purpose=inline)

1\. Device intelligence

Identify the device a user is using, determine its brand, model and variant, and retrieve structured specifications.

[Technician repairing a smartphone at a workbench using a microscope screen and small tools in an electronics lab.](https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/jq-RK775my2fGl4oAIDiUGQXMgzQ_jgVmS3m60EQuJfRkWvJv-J6WgobMT8mU7r1pSjXiSGL4dCq5aQIWsYgdDgb4MldoWDY_a57HsEz_VS3e5zEfK3qnDwue7lDh5eohPzGsVaa5jmKsdnaptnXGxDo7K_jDOqzMDy12BzNKWs396zyQw5OBoJqpK6sWgCP?purpose=inline)

2\. Verification and evidence

Build a reliable record of what is known about a device, including supported IMEI checks, diagnostics, and verification history where available.

[KREAM 중고/리퍼비쉬 폰 서비스 '더 폰(The Phone)' 이용 후기](https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/McJlu3YBd3lC-tQVdccui9G4_YmAS52vHYS1wVe-gsxagFg0OH52kxgxfjBBr02x9RfHm_q3cR5dNWr5EW1j6oDVfvFtjDvL5VPxMG-C2c0XOU3DaVUSYHZGleKG-5S7WKRHrVsGlmFnvif2zWNGz9sIwELLDR32PT9P4lP7n2w?purpose=inline)

3\. Trust, condition and valuation

Turn evidence into transparent trust assessments, condition information and defensible pricing estimates.

[Certified Pre-Owned iPhones & Tech - Up to 60% Off | Plug](https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/zRojeNcsvkxHxIaWmgESSBmMMlLul6y-mwA387v4JSNNxTWpcdP7JzAesNzKt6X7bwH27JAhvhLvYE5SRPW9yGacrUL6AscEvNpzd7aF3YeYvVLmSF92QwT5GnY7ak9kfgdRX4f-wUsesTyFBmD6gkyegVpMwioyIpySoHQenD4?purpose=inline)

4\. Verified-device marketplace

Let buyers discover devices and assess their details, while sellers list products with structured specifications and supported verification information.

[How We Grade | Mobile Depot Europe](https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/RU-8kBU-29ANSP-70mKUP0s94mrQ9gIX05g1KNVjxcrSOYQL-VyHGY3o7n3V3FEmFTViBi8jhd8bv0aV2L_xeOoYC0xaKGPmj5vtL4zlL_AmRPMbJamurls8JJnaNip7r-3td0XjIPjj4xfkvMHIYXCqK4pYFhJAwbmf-UYErHM?purpose=inline)

5\. Proprietary technology and scalable operations

Build the data, scoring, device records, APIs, verification processes and operational tools that can eventually distinguish Rebox from a basic buy-and-sell website.

The marketplace is the customer-facing product. The device-intelligence layer is the long-term technological advantage. Both must work together.

## 2. What has been achieved so far

The status labels below distinguish known implementation work from functionality that still needs to be tested.

Project foundation and technology stack

Established

- Next.js and React application using TypeScript.
- Tailwind CSS for styling.
- Supabase as the database and backend service.
- Project configuration, application routes, reusable components and development tests are present in the source inventory.

Branding and homepage

Completed for planning

- Rebox branding and visual direction.
- Homepage and navigation work.
- Marketplace category presentation.
- Device-detection hero and image-generation work.

The hero and image generation are treated as complete. They are not outstanding roadmap tasks.

Marketplace page structure

Files present

- Product listing and category routes.
- Product-detail route.
- Product cards, category cards and product sliders.
- Homepage sections for deals, best sellers, reviews, newsletter, trust, and FAQs.
- Navigation, dropdowns and footer components.

These files establish a substantial storefront structure. Complete purchasing and seller workflows have not been confirmed.

Device identification foundation

Previously demonstrated

- A device-detection module and API routes.
- `devices` and `device_identifiers` database structures have been worked on.
- A `device_variants` table has been introduced.
- A previous identification response successfully returned a detected iPhone 15 Pro variant with confidence `1`.
- The device catalogue lookup uses identifiers to retrieve structured device information.

This proves that an identification path has worked at least once; it does not establish coverage across all devices or production reliability.

Device-intelligence modules

Files present; integration unverified

The source inventory includes modules for:

- Trust scoring.
- Device valuation.
- Diagnostics.
- Device passports.
- Trust reports and trust-score cards.
- Verification previews and intelligence badges.
- Catalog reconciliation.
- Evidence persistence.
- Physical-device registration.
- Identifier hashing and rate limiting.

The presence of these modules is a useful foundation. Their accuracy, integration and user-facing completeness still need auditing.

IMEI verification investigation

Integration unverified

An IMEI-information provider was investigated for technical information and blacklist status. The current connection, provider reliability, coverage and production readiness have not been confirmed.

Automated testing foundation

Test files present

Tests exist for identifier hashing, physical-device registration and the device-identification route. Whether the entire suite passes and whether important failure cases are covered remain unknown.

