- `lib/rebox/trust.ts` — trust-related logic.
- `lib/rebox/diagnostics.ts` — diagnostics module.
- `lib/rebox/passport.ts` — device passport module.
- `lib/rebox/valutaion.ts` — valuation module; filename spelling should be reviewed before renaming.
- `lib/supabase.ts` — public Supabase client.
- `lib/supabase-admin.ts` — privileged server-side Supabase client.
- `lib/utils.ts` — shared utilities.

### Supporting files

